  "details": "I feel like that a chat feature would be amazing, where you are able to message your friend who are on vrc while you are on. Now I know a lot of people are friends on discord but not everyone is so if we had a feature we're we are able to message our friends who are online would be great. It would be a lot easier instead of sending them and invite and trying to communicate through that, cause they might be on Orange or red and they might just join you instead of communication. So I think having a messaging feature would be better to see what your friends are doing and if they are free or busy without joining them.",
